    "https://www.imperial.ac.uk/jobs/career-programmes/finance-graduate-scheme-/finance/example-placements/": {
      "title": "Example placements",
      "description": "Example placements | Jobs | Imperial College London Skip to main content View accessibility support page Search Search Menu Study Research Faculties News Events About Get involved Giving Shop Imperial Search Search Website navigation Close Key links This section Skip to section navigation Global site navigation Study Course search Subjects Apply Fees and funding Student life Visit Help centre Request info International students Lifelong Learning Summer schools Research Faculties Faculty of Engineering Faculty of Medicine Faculty of Natural Sciences Imperial Business School Administrative and support services News News Imperial Stories Imperial Magazine Events What's on Great Exhibition Road Festival Imperial Lates Graduation About President Provost and Deputy President Council Imperial Strategy League tables and rankings Imperial Global Sustainable Imperial School of Convergence Science Governance Campuses Our academics Jobs at Imperial Get involved Giving Schools outreach Imperial Global Summer School Societal engagement Volunteering and outreach Women at Imperial Giving Shop Imperial User links navigation For staff Current students Imperial for business For schools Alumni Career programmes Finance Graduate Scheme navigation Graduate Finance Training Scheme About Apply Learning and development Example placements Financial Accounting Faculty offices Management Reporting Trainee profiles Ellie Andrew Ed Isabel Max Kavan Izzy Hiro Salary and benefits Person specification Frequently Asked Questions In this section Finance Graduate Scheme Financial Accounting Faculty offices Management Reporting Finance Graduate Scheme Imperial Home Jobs Career programmes Finance Graduate Scheme Graduate Finance Training Scheme Example placements Example placements Graduate Finance Training Scheme Financial Accounting Faculty offices Management Reporting All Graduate Finance Analysts undertake a range of placements across the College. The following pages give examples of where a Graduate Finance Analyst might work, but all Analyts take an individual path through the scheme. There are opportunities for placements in other Departments or Divisions not listed here; the scheme is flexible which enables it to best meet the needs of both the College and the Finance Graduate Analysts. Placements in specific areas of work cannot be guaranteed but the Scheme Director takes into account the preferences and aspirations of the Analyst when allocating placements where possible. The successful candidate may also be asked to get involved in other projects outside of their placements to support their development. 1 of 3 Previous Media Item Pause Next Media Item Financial Accounting Central to the College's Finance function, the Financial Accounting team is responsible for the year end accounts and for managing the year end audit. Faculty Offices Graduate Finance Analysts on a placement in a Faculty Office will usually report direct to the Faculty Finance Officer. Faculty placements offer analysts an insight into the role of a Faculty within the College. Management Reporting Part of College’s Central Financial Management function, Management Reporting is responsible for the provision of financial analysis, advice and support to Faculties, Academic and Support Services. Useful Links Popular links Canvas Contact the Service Desk Jobs Library services Outlook email online Faculties Engineering Medicine Natural Sciences Imperial Business School Directories Admin and support services Networks and Centres Research groups Search all staff Partners Imperial College Academic Health Science Centre Imperial College Health Partners Imperial College Healthcare NHS Trust Imperial Consultants College Information Imperial College London Address Imperial College London South Kensington Campus London SW7 2AZ , UK tel: +44 (0)20 7589 5111 Facebook X, formerly known as Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Instagram TikTok Bluesky Site Information Sitemap Accessibility Moder